# Track reproducible release tooling, but keep generated release binaries ignored.
!scripts/
!scripts/release/
!scripts/release/*.ps1
!scripts/release/*.cmd
!release/
!release/README.md
# 跟踪直接启动 Release 所需的 MSVC x64 CRT（C++ 运行库）可再分发文件。
!resources/
!resources/runtime/
!resources/runtime/win-x64/
!resources/runtime/win-x64/*.dll
artifacts/
